{"ticker":"IDXX","updated":"2026-10-30T22:53:17Z","profile":{"longName":"IDEXX Laboratories, Inc.","shortName":"IDEXX Laboratories, Inc.","sector":"Healthcare","industry":"Diagnostics & Research","country":"United States","website":"https://www.idexx.com","fullTimeEmployees":11000,"marketCap":43424944128,"trailingPE":38.73577,"forwardPE":32.94173,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":9.537188,"pegRatio":3.15,"targetMeanPrice":694.4167,"targetHighPrice":805.0,"targetLowPrice":470.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":12,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.097,"earningsGrowth":0.176,"grossMargins":0.62446,"operatingMargins":0.3498,"profitMargins":0.25030002,"totalRevenue":4553223168,"beta":1.548,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":769.98,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":500.61,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"IDEXX Laboratories, Inc. develops, manufactures, and distributes products for the companion animal veterinary, livestock and poultry, dairy, and water testing industries in the United States and internationally. It operates through three segments: Companion Animal Group; Water Quality Products; and Livestock, Poultry and Dairy. The company offers point-of-care diagnostic solutions, blood and urine chemistry, hematology, immunoassay, urinalysis, cytology/morphology, and coagulation analyzers; and SNAP rapid assays test kits. It also provides commercial reference laboratory diagnostic and consulting services to veterinarians; veterinary consultation, telemedicine, and advisory services, including radiology, dental radiography, cardiology, internal medicine, and ultrasound consulting; Colilert, Colilert-18, and Colisure tests, which detect the presence of total coliforms and E. coli in water; Enterolert, Pseudalert, Filta-Max and Filta-Max xpress, Legiolert, Quanti-Tray products, and Tecta system instruments; UV Viewer Plus, a UV light cabinet which aids in the visual interpretation of fluorescent-based water tests; and veterinary software and services for independent veterinary clinics and corporate groups. In addition, the company offers diagnostic tests, services, and related instrumentation to manage the health status of livestock and poultry; human medical diagnostic products","summary_zh":"IDEXX Laboratories, Inc. 為美國和國際上的伴侶動物獸醫、家畜和家禽、乳製品和水測試行業開發、製造和分銷產品。它透過三個部門運作：伴侶動物集團；水質產品；以及畜牧業、家禽業和乳製品業。該公司提供即時診斷解決方案、血液和尿液化學、血液學、免疫分析、尿液分析、細胞學/形態學和凝血分析儀；和 SNAP 快速檢測試劑盒。它還為獸醫提供商業參考實驗室診斷和諮詢服務；獸醫諮詢、遠距醫療和諮詢服務，包括放射學、牙科放射學、心臟病學、內科和超音波諮詢； Colilert、Colilert-18 和 Colisure 測試，檢測水中是否存在總大腸桿菌群和大腸桿菌； Viewer Plus，紫外線燈櫃，有助於對基於螢光的水測試進行視覺解釋；以及為獨立獸醫診所和企業集團提供獸醫軟體和服務。此外，該公司還提供診斷測試、服務和相關儀器來管理牲畜和家禽的健康狀況；人體醫學診斷產品","sector_zh":"衛生保健","industry_zh":"診斷與研究","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":637.05,"h":641.21,"l":630.54,"c":639.45,"v":440500},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":640.99,"h":642.01,"l":626.24,"c":633.95,"v":373500},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":637.71,"h":642.47,"l":629.55,"c":640.44,"v":440500},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":640.0,"h":649.16,"l":630.87,"c":642.99,"v":370400},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":644.42,"h":654.05,"l":640.26,"c":652.83,"v":460600},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":652.83,"h":655.77,"l":647.79,"c":655.6,"v":271800},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":652.91,"h":653.67,"l":631.74,"c":637.95,"v":389100},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":637.14,"h":648.29,"l":637.14,"c":645.16,"v":337000},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":639.24,"h":644.86,"l":625.55,"c":641.14,"v":317900},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":641.73,"h":651.33,"l":641.73,"c":643.99,"v":455300},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":640.37,"h":648.32,"l":635.5,"c":645.65,"v":404500},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":644.59,"h":651.05,"l":637.0,"c":640.86,"v":444500},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":642.53,"h":659.17,"l":635.94,"c":655.51,"v":474200},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":659.58,"h":661.39,"l":648.85,"c":656.16,"v":981500},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":653.17,"h":657.11,"l":640.28,"c":644.1,"v":386900},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":640.34,"h":649.47,"l":640.34,"c":648.38,"v":351200},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":645.12,"h":645.12,"l":621.36,"c":627.17,"v":464500},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":620.93,"h":621.13,"l":613.28,"c